# British English

All documentation uses British English.

| Use | Not |
|-----|-----|
| colour | color |
| behaviour | behavior |
| organise | organize |
| recognise | recognize |
| centre | center |
| licence (n) | license |
| artefacts | artefacts |

Date format: DD/MM/YYYY
